00:15:59.150 --> 00:16:01.290
Get in touch with Master Arai about this, Hina.

00:16:01.290 --> 00:16:02.340
Right!

00:16:03.690 --> 00:16:05.590
What are you guys doing?

00:16:05.990 --> 00:16:07.650
What's the matter, Azumabashi?

00:16:14.170 --> 00:16:17.400
I'll be waiting at Magami's schoolyard.

00:16:17.400 --> 00:16:18.670
I'll be waiting at Magami's schoolyard.
Oh, now this looks like fun.

00:16:18.670 --> 00:16:21.160
Oh, now this looks like fun.

00:16:21.540 --> 00:16:23.670
Are you okay, Sagaya?!

00:16:23.670 --> 00:16:28.440
Maiko, l... I'll take care of things here.

00:16:29.050 --> 00:16:30.950
You at least need to escape.

00:16:30.950 --> 00:16:32.920
I can't do that!

00:16:33.580 --> 00:16:36.640
Reiji Sagaya, Maiko Takamizawa...

00:16:37.660 --> 00:16:39.420
Prepare to die.

00:17:15.130 --> 00:17:16.260
Heya, Yuu!

00:17:16.260 --> 00:17:18.660
What up? He's finally here!

00:17:18.660 --> 00:17:20.970
Where the heck were you, man?

00:17:20.970 --> 00:17:22.070
Yeah, you're late!

00:17:22.070 --> 00:17:23.930
What are we gonna do about dinner?

00:17:24.440 --> 00:17:25.900
Hey, Yuu!

00:17:30.140 --> 00:17:31.770
Yuu...

00:17:33.810 --> 00:17:35.640
Renji Magatsu!

00:17:36.810 --> 00:17:40.220
Long time, no see, Yuu.

00:17:40.720 --> 00:17:41.850
Kisaragi!

00:17:41.850 --> 00:17:43.990
Lady Aoi! You're all right then?

00:17:43.990 --> 00:17:46.080
Yeah, I'm glad you are too.

00:17:46.590 --> 00:17:48.750
What the heck is going on?

00:17:49.060 --> 00:17:52.000
It's too dangerous to stay here.
I'll explain later.

00:17:52.630 --> 00:17:53.530
What about the others?

00:17:53.530 --> 00:17:56.590
Master Ryuzan is gathering them together.
We should hurry there too!

00:17:57.340 --> 00:17:58.500
Okay!

00:18:01.210 --> 00:18:03.110
You okay, Azumabashi?

00:18:03.470 --> 00:18:05.480
I can't eat anymore...

00:18:05.480 --> 00:18:06.310
Hey!

00:18:06.310 --> 00:18:08.480
Huh? Boss?

00:18:08.480 --> 00:18:11.320
Boss! You came for me!

00:18:11.320 --> 00:18:12.450
What happened?

00:18:12.450 --> 00:18:16.010
Well, this friggin' weirdo just
came outta nowhere, and...

00:18:17.590 --> 00:18:20.560
Ah! That's the guy, Boss!

00:18:22.730 --> 00:18:24.990
I've grown weary waiting for you.

00:18:25.400 --> 00:18:28.960
You're the one who left the
ridiculous challenge letter?

00:18:30.200 --> 00:18:32.860
I've been looking forward
to seeing you, Kyouichi.

00:18:33.700 --> 00:18:37.040
I'm surprised you still remembered this place.

00:18:38.210 --> 00:18:42.840
I thought you'd have totally forgotten about me.

00:18:43.210 --> 00:18:45.310
Oh, Yuu...

00:18:46.920 --> 00:18:53.190
What is it? What's the deal?
Can't you look me in the eye?

00:18:54.560 --> 00:18:58.030
Ah, that's right. Yeah, that's it.

00:18:58.030 --> 00:19:04.330
It's 'cuz you betrayed me that day, right?

00:19:05.600 --> 00:19:12.740
Oh, Yuu, do you know what's been going
through my head nonstop ever since then?

00:19:15.750 --> 00:19:17.080
Well?

00:19:21.220 --> 00:19:23.310
You have power?!

00:19:23.720 --> 00:19:27.530
I'm here to settle the score, Daigo.

00:19:27.530 --> 00:19:29.490
What's the deal?

00:19:30.590 --> 00:19:35.200
Oh, I just had to meet this so-called
Kabukicho "samurai for hire".

00:19:35.200 --> 00:19:37.870
They said you're a pretty good-looking fellow.

00:19:37.870 --> 00:19:42.100
Then you should have just come
straight up to me, dumb ass.

00:19:43.470 --> 00:19:45.710
But this is our most anticipated first meeting.

00:19:45.710 --> 00:19:50.870
Something more romantic and stimulating
would make for lovely memories

00:19:51.180 --> 00:19:53.150
of your final moments of life.

00:19:54.990 --> 00:19:57.350
You're pissing me off more and more.

00:19:57.350 --> 00:19:58.580
Tell me your name.

00:19:58.960 --> 00:20:02.860
I am Ukon Yatsurugi, one of the Twelve
Generals of the Martial Fist.

00:20:03.560 --> 00:20:06.190
I like the strong, pretty type,

00:20:06.460 --> 00:20:08.060
but do you fit the bill?

00:20:08.600 --> 00:20:12.370
You sonnuva bitch, you're gonna regret this.

00:20:13.200 --> 00:20:14.540
Regret?

00:20:14.540 --> 00:20:16.700
I'm afraid I am not familiar with that word.

00:20:17.210 --> 00:20:19.540
Stop! Cut it out.

00:20:19.880 --> 00:20:25.780
There's no need to hold back. Since we
both have power, let's go all out.

00:20:27.490 --> 00:20:29.650
What's the matter, traitor?

00:20:29.650 --> 00:20:31.810
You're wrong! I...

00:20:32.220 --> 00:20:33.620
I...

00:20:42.130 --> 00:20:44.800
Running away again, Daigo?

00:20:44.800 --> 00:20:48.360
From me? And from this place?!

00:21:01.590 --> 00:21:02.850
What the heck...

00:21:03.420 --> 00:21:04.920
Surprised?

00:21:04.920 --> 00:21:07.190
It's a technique called Demonic Beheading.

00:21:07.190 --> 00:21:09.890
Though now I've shown you
the extent of my prowess.

00:21:09.890 --> 00:21:11.760
Have I frightened you?

00:21:11.760 --> 00:21:13.460
What was that?

00:21:23.210 --> 00:21:26.980
You've got some split ends here. What a waste.

00:21:26.980 --> 00:21:28.670
You stinkin'...

00:21:29.050 --> 00:21:32.350
Your footwork is impressive, most impressive.

00:21:32.880 --> 00:21:35.080
Damn, how come I'm not connecting?!

00:21:35.290 --> 00:21:36.840
Why can't I see him move?

00:21:39.120 --> 00:21:40.250
There...

00:21:47.260 --> 00:21:48.390
What...

00:21:58.580 --> 00:22:00.600
B..Boss!

00:22:01.010 --> 00:22:02.950
Far less than I had expected.

00:22:04.080 --> 00:22:06.280
Farewell, Kyouichi.

00:22:06.850 --> 00:22:08.980
Boss... Boss!

00:22:09.450 --> 00:22:11.850
Boss!

00:22:12.090 --> 00:22:15.750
No! Fuck!

00:22:24.130 --> 00:22:25.500
Who are you?

00:22:26.870 --> 00:22:28.270
You are...

00:22:29.770 --> 00:22:31.500
Tatsuma Hiyu...

00:22:34.080 --> 00:22:35.980
Mibu Kureha...

00:22:41.890 --> 00:22:46.990
I sadly hung my head a bit

00:22:46.990 --> 00:22:51.690
And finally you murmured

00:22:52.100 --> 00:22:56.330
What I heard was a faint goodbye

00:22:56.330 --> 00:23:01.270
Said with all your might

00:23:03.210 --> 00:23:12.480
Our pulses echo in the awkward silence

00:23:12.480 --> 00:23:14.350
We can see each other again

00:23:14.350 --> 00:23:16.850
Let's meet up again some time

00:23:16.850 --> 00:23:22.660
Let's each set out in search of our own futures

00:23:22.660 --> 00:23:27.160
For the kindness you gave me for my heartache

00:23:27.160 --> 00:23:31.600
I thank you now

00:23:32.770 --> 00:23:37.410
These flower petals seem just as if

00:23:37.410 --> 00:23:38.840
They were blessing us

00:23:38.840 --> 00:23:43.050
As we depart on our journeys

00:23:43.050 --> 00:23:47.420
I won't forget your warmth

00:23:47.420 --> 00:23:51.880
That overwhelmed my loneliness

00:23:52.690 --> 00:23:57.790
I thank you now

00:24:06.540 --> 00:24:07.470
Next Episode

